# Payment access control (this repository)

Follow [docs/adr/0002-billing-access-control-and-webhook-signatures.md](../../docs/adr/0002-billing-access-control-and-webhook-signatures.md) and [docs/agents/security.md](../../docs/agents/security.md).

## Required

- `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` verified **before** parse / use case on provider callbacks
- `BILLING_API_KEY` on machine writable routes (`Bearer` / `X-Api-Key`)
- Browser flows: Server Action or BFF — **no** billing secrets in client bundles
- Fail closed when secrets missing (do not leave anonymous open demos)
- Health/read-only probes may remain public when intentional

## Forbidden

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` for `BILLING_API_KEY` / webhook secrets
- Trusting raw webhook JSON without signature verification
- “Mock Stripe means we skip auth” as a design choice
